    "methods_description": "Participants performed a Matlab-based reinforcement learning task with volitional and instructed choices while EEG was recorded. Parkinson's patients attended two sessions separated by one week, ON or OFF medication; controls attended one session. A triaxial accelerometer (X, Y, Z) was taped to the most tremor-affected hand. Data were collected around 2015 at the Cognitive Rhythms and Computation Lab, University of New Mexico.",
